      "message": "This change is originally from mediatek and is already included in `android13-5.15`. I don\u0027t know how they are using it, but I can say that Pixel is using this hook as well for scheduler performance tuning. In particular it\u0027s used to help find a more energy efficient CPU. On 5.10 is was called `rvh_cpumask_any_and_distribute` (https://r.android.com/2108045). For 5.15, the driver has been re-worked to re-use this vendor hook from `android13-5.15`.",
