      "writtenOn": "2023-03-15T18:11:18Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The difference between this hook and the other one is that the previous one doesn\u0027t pass in the task_struct pointer which is used to find a more energy efficient cpu. I\u0027m fine with dropping/modifying `trace_android_rvh_set_cpus_allowed_ptr_locked` to take the task_struct pointer so that we only have 1 hook here, but that will require whoever is using it to update their driver on the next KMI breakage window. Do you prefer that?.\n\nNote: both of these hooks are included in `android13-5.15`.",
      "parentUuid": "be6b632b_9b930610",
      "revId": "4c819b7aef57874c4a424211f5062d811776955b",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
